  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc43:2.1.11": "“Ridge beam” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>piṭṭhivaṁsa</i>. Sp 2.280: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Piṭṭhivaṁsaṁ atikkamitvāti iminā majjhātikkamaṁ dasseti</i>; “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Piṭṭhivaṁsaṁ atikkamitvā</i>: by this going beyond the middle is shown.” ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc43:2.2.0": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc43:2.2.1": "“Bedroom” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sayanighara</i>, literally, “house for sleeping”. Kkh-pṭ: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sayanigharanti sayanīyagharaṁ, vāsagehanti attho</i>, “Bedroom: a house to be slept in. The meaning is a house for living in.” ",
